{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022121109039-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022182342\"/><p>女事主送院治理。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>紅磡發生扶手梯意外。今日(22日)早上11時33分，一名60歲男子在港鐵黃埔站近民兆街出口使用扶手梯時懷疑失平衡跌倒，期間再撞跌在旁兩名人士。救護車接報到場，發現其中一名捱撞的姓鄭(63歲)婦人腳部受傷，遂安排她送院治理，另外兩名人士並無大礙，拒絕送院。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:29.077693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:11:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.630376+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:38:08.834975+00:00","content_hash":"8a1c5837be16419ee66a4fa751ecf9c034cc847f87d3742129e20b111228bf88","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:29.077693+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}